  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7861fd32ae3a75a9019aba524458bf7b, type: 3}
  m_Name: LoadingTips
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LoadingTipsData
  tips:
  - 'You may rotate a held block with 1 / 2 / 3. '
  - "Turrets need a block touching them to stay powered \u2014 moving their support
    strands them."
  - Hold right-click and drag to orbit the camera; scroll to zoom.
  - In Select mode, drag a box to select multiple placed blocks at once.
  - A longer enemy path buys your turrets more time to fire.
  - "Synergies activate when matching-color blocks form a connected shape \u2014
    check the HUD to see which ones are close."
  - Press F to open the shop, and Space to start the next wave.
  - Long press R to restart the level if you get stuck.
  - You may place new turrets and blocks during combat, but you can't edit the existed
    ones.
  - You may also place block and turret when pausing.
  - When some UI is blocking the view, try holding Left Shift!
  - During the battle, hold Left Shift to display enemies' HP temporarily.
